1
00:00:03,378 --> 00:00:04,958
[SINGING ALONG TO RADIO]
Goin' out tonight

2
00:00:05,130 --> 00:00:07,050
I'm feelin' all right

3
00:00:07,215 --> 00:00:10,755
Gonna let it all hang out

4
00:00:10,927 --> 00:00:13,097
Wanna make some noise

5
00:00:13,263 --> 00:00:14,723
Really raise my voice

6
00:00:14,889 --> 00:00:18,389
Yeah, I wanna scream and shout

7
00:00:21,604 --> 00:00:23,394
Unh! No--

8
00:00:23,565 --> 00:00:26,815
(Penny:)Morning, Sheldon. Come dance with me.

9
00:00:27,694 --> 00:00:28,734
(Sheldon:)No.

10
00:00:30,488 --> 00:00:31,908
(Penny:)Why not?

11
00:00:32,073 --> 00:00:35,493
(Sheldon:)Penny, while I subscribe
to the Many-Worlds theory...

12
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:39,120
...which posits the existence of infinite
Sheldons in an infinite number...

13
00:00:39,289 --> 00:00:43,589
(Sheldon:)...of universes, I assure you
that none of them am I dancing.

14
00:00:44,169 --> 00:00:47,089
(Penny:)Are you fun in any of them?

15
00:00:47,547 --> 00:00:51,677
(Sheldon:)The math would suggest that in a few,
I'm a clown made of candy.

16
00:00:53,303 --> 00:00:55,053
(Sheldon:)But I don't dance.

17
00:00:55,597 --> 00:00:58,517
(Penny:)-All right, want some French toast?
-It's oatmeal day.

18
00:00:59,893 --> 00:01:03,023
(Penny:)Tell you what, next French toast day,
I will make you oatmeal.

